            "value" : "このリンクにはカードが含まれていません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This will permanently delete all %lld cards. This action cannot be undone." : {
      "comment" : "Message in the delete-all dialog. The argument is how many cards there are, always at least one.",
